{"title":"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(by_looking_at_the_answer_choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (by looking at the answer choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(The_Fastest_Way)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (The Fastest Way)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(MOST_EFFICIENT+_CREATIVE_THINKING!!!(BTW_WE_LOVE_THIS_ONE))\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (MOST EFFICIENT+ CREATIVE THINKING!!!(BTW WE LOVE THIS ONE))</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic(1_to_25_Full_Solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Qiang drives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles at an average speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. How many additional miles will he have to drive at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour to average <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour for the entire trip?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95bcc933ee16c8caeae2ece2356a9920c8f0e20e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }45\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }62\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }90\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }110\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }135$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"416\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28by_looking_at_the_answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(by_looking_at_the_answer_choices)\">Solution 1 (by looking at the answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (by looking at the answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The only option that is easily divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79dc7d13216568e73c831d7b8c14c1a30f7831a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, which gives 2 hours of travel. And, the formula is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/613dec39188d1c8e353e082cb1a0967ffbf49e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{30} + \\frac{110}{55} = \\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>And, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55dc8228e73c113d0993026f86555f72f82584ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Average Speed}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/6238638857c89d562f43d19c145f7fdc210f543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\text{Total Distance}}{\\text{Total Time}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d82d36d44f70e04586566a64332a0dc6d53bc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{125}{50} = \\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"67\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Both are equal and thus our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/d/52db3d8956b189719ceec46ebe6aeb660ef9c089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 110}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"77\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To calculate the average speed, simply evaluate the total distance over the total time. Let the number of additional miles he has to drive be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> Therefore, the total distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a16a184af5d85f983ade3d776b5e68dc2c5a297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> and the total time (in hours) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa0a8f8d7aee64b52fba8f7ec3c7cc0e5a67416.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{15}{30}+\\frac{x}{55}=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{x}{55}.\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"37\" /> We can set up the following equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/80419da878b6f43d2ce0eb55fdb332542584e9b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{15+x}{\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{x}{55}}=50.\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"44\" /> Simplifying the equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c48a48d74aa538bf0f66c7a122dfea6e814dba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15+x=25+\\frac{10x}{11}.\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"38\" /> Solving the equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cb6af99eba705e00c74f9475ff924f7ceed5499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=110,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" /> so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0224f8d5676b53811590cff7594356813ddf2a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If he travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles at a speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour, he travels for 30 min. Average rate is total distance over total time so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/0/ba06c2ae3fe588d46901777b1badf1380742e62f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(15+d)/(0.5 + t) = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />, where d is the distance left to travel and t is the time to travel that distance. Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3be63df5e2771f6f35998fa30b5cfa72429963f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 10+50t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />. You also know that he has to travel <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour for some time, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/0/f90f093355b7343d61a52b5439a7788ba561c666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=55t$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. Plug that in for d to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114f89a4b77a62f8c98c9d419b0a0846f0c10889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55t = 10+50t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80d4822fd227ceb0ef72b1bd9326703a98f8593c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=2$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/0/f90f093355b7343d61a52b5439a7788ba561c666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=55t$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/268bc28448b921f0a96e2007192400f9cea9bea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 2\\cdot55 =110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"125\" height=\"13\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0224f8d5676b53811590cff7594356813ddf2a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be the amount of hours Qiang drives after his first 15 miles. Average speed, which we know is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mph, means total distance over total time. For 15 miles at 30 mph, the time taken is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> hour, so the total time for this trip would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e64fa5f7880b5c1fb0291d13d9b99043cde429e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" /> hours. For the total distance, 15 miles are traveled in the first part and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/64773fc7936663ec8d67348df02c0167c6329c7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> miles in the second. This gives the following equation: \n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/0/170a84d084986bf793a69559927b925c875d8bc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{15+55h}{\\frac{1}{2}+h} = 50.\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"44\" /> \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\nCross multiplying, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b680ad30c77103c8db8c75deaa137711cf723a90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 + 55h = 50h + 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" />, and simple algebra gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43d1bb0add295f2569984fefb02549404e4ac507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. In 2 hours traveling at 55 mph, the distance traveled is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/e/2de23626540efc9b9bfc2bc5d23b7df8d49fe968.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2 \\hspace{0.05 in} \\text{hours}}{1} \\cdot \\frac{55 \\hspace{0.05 in} \\text{miles}}{1 \\hspace{0.05 in} \\text{hour}} = 2 \\cdot 55 \\hspace{0.05 in} \\text{miles} = 110 \\hspace{0.05 in} \\text{miles}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"341\" height=\"38\" />, which is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0224f8d5676b53811590cff7594356813ddf2a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n~TaeKim\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IgpayYB48C4?si=8YldGqXbPzZfeA-z&amp;t=4756\">https://youtu.be/IgpayYB48C4?si=8YldGqXbPzZfeA-z&amp;t=4756</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p><p><br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OC1KdFeZFeE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OC1KdFeZFeE</a>\n</p><p>Associated Video\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5K1AgeZ8rUQ\">https://youtu.be/5K1AgeZ8rUQ</a> \n</p><p>- happytwin\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0rcDe2bDRug\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0rcDe2bDRug</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution detailing how to solve the problem: \n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sEZ0sM-d1FA&amp;list=PLbhMrFqoXXwmwbk2CWeYOYPRbGtmdPUhL&amp;index=17\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sEZ0sM-d1FA&amp;list=PLbhMrFqoXXwmwbk2CWeYOYPRbGtmdPUhL&amp;index=17</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aFsC5awOWBk\">https://youtu.be/aFsC5awOWBk</a>\n</p><p>- Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/btmFN_C1zSg\">https://youtu.be/btmFN_C1zSg</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28The_Fastest_Way.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(The_Fastest_Way)\">Video Solution (The Fastest Way)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (The Fastest Way)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IOhkO3c3c2A&amp;ab_channel=SaxStreak002\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IOhkO3c3c2A&amp;ab_channel=SaxStreak002</a>\n</p><p>~SaxStreak\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28MOST_EFFICIENT.2B_CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.28BTW_WE_LOVE_THIS_ONE.29.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(MOST_EFFICIENT+_CREATIVE_THINKING!!!(BTW_WE_LOVE_THIS_ONE))\">Video Solution (MOST EFFICIENT+ CREATIVE THINKING!!!(BTW WE LOVE THIS ONE))</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (MOST EFFICIENT+ CREATIVE THINKING!!!(BTW WE LOVE THIS ONE))\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/JiTos1fFtUA\">https://youtu.be/JiTos1fFtUA</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic.281_to_25_Full_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic(1_to_25_Full_Solution)\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY\">https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9Wo